# Acceptance replay: offline solo play-through of Evergreen (seed 1).
# Title -> main menu (boot_menu), Play now -> world list, Evergreen -> the Well,
# N = New Soul, type the name, RETURN = OK (hero_ready) -> incarnate on map 0 (map_enter).
expect boot_menu 900
# FUN_00402A73's Terms of Service modal opens on entry to the main menu (front.c:534
# tos_gate, consumed at front.c:770) and swallows the next key. "I Accept" is
# tos_accept = (356,371,75,23), so its centre is (393,382).
click 393 382
expect tos_accept 300
key RETURN
wait 30
# FUN_0041B891's own table (all.c:21078) has THREE states before the Well, not two:
#   1 main menu -> 2 "Where Do You Want To Play Today?" (splash, art\where.jpg, FUN_0041D31F)
#   2 -> 3 "Choose Your World" + the world list (art\chapter.jpg, FUN_0041D717)
#   3 -> take the highlighted row (msg 0x474) -> the Pick-a-Soul window
# The old port collapsed the splash; the three states are the original's, so the script
# spends one more RETURN on them. RETURN is the plan's keyboard shortcut for the click.
# State 2 is where FUN_0041F699 makes its synchronous 0x46F call, which raises
# SRNet's modal (0x42AA10). 1005 "Solo Game" is (250,313,299,23) -> centre
# (399,324); control 1 "Play Game" is (250,380,75,23) -> centre (287,391).
# 1005 then 1 closes it, 0x46F returns 1, FUN_0041D374 registers
# "--- Scanning ---", and the stepper FUN_00438E8E runs ~30 calls (6140 to
# 8340 ms) before FUN_0041B891(3) draws the world list.
click 399 324
wait 10
click 630 309
wait 240
# State 3 is the world list; RETURN takes the highlighted row
# (msg 0x474), which is the keyboard shortcut for the row's click.
key RETURN
wait 30
key n
wait 5
text Tester
key RETURN
# The New Soul chain (NewSoulOnOK 0x460A7E, dialog 149, dialog 180): PK review Yes,
# ability points OK, apply the rest randomly Yes, Use This Skin.
wait 2
key RETURN
wait 2
key RETURN
wait 2
key RETURN
wait 2
key RETURN
expect hero_ready 300
expect map_enter 600
# Incarnate's "Place Yourself On Gaiea!" Sage box is modal over the map: answer No.
key n
wait 2
# The hero lands ON link 0 (179,219), the embark scene. One step east and he comes to rest
# inside it, which fires it (the latch only holds while he has not walked).
hold RIGHT 4
expect scene_enter 600
# quest.txt:1774 is an `ASK 30` -- "Do you agree to obey the golden rule? (type YES or NO)".
# Speech no longer blocks the lines after it, so the ASK comes up with the third bubble:
# two RETURNs clear the first two, `y` answers YES (scene.c ST_ASK).
wait 40
key RETURN
wait 40
key RETURN
wait 40
key y
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 40
key RETURN
wait 40
# The Soul Brother's OFFER2 shop: close it, then clear the farewell lines.
expect panel_open 600
key ESCAPE
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
wait 20
key RETURN
expect map_enter 2000
# Out of the link in ONE walk (arrow keys step a cell at a time and would stop inside it):
# (245,142) is (194,220) from (179,220). Then south until a random encounter.
click 245 142
expect hero_move 300
wait 60
keydown DOWN
expect battle_start 1200
keyup DOWN
# Fight: A attacks the first live monster; the attack is queued until the hero's turn.
key a
wait 10
key a
wait 10
key a
wait 10
